faction-hezbollah =
    .name = Hezbollah
    .description = Fictional RTS faction: light forces, concealment and guided support.

levant-hzrifle-name = Line Fighter
levant-hzrifle-description = Inexpensive rifle infantry. Conceals while stationary; moving, firing or taking damage reveals it. Detectors and artillery defeat isolated positions.

levant-hzat-name = Ridge Missile Team
levant-hzat-description = Light anti-armor missile infantry. A signal post or scout improves range and reload. Vulnerable to infantry, detectors and air attacks.

levant-hzspotter-name = Field Spotter
levant-hzspotter-description = Reconnaissance specialist who detects cloaked units and guides nearby eligible missile teams and vehicles. A weak weapon makes escorts essential.

levant-hzscout-name = Cedar Scout
levant-hzscout-description = One concealed scout with a suppressed carbine and demolition ability. Stationary concealment breaks when firing, moving or damaged. Vulnerable once detected.

levant-hztechnical-name = Cedar Technical
levant-hztechnical-description = Fast and inexpensive machine-gun vehicle. Strong against exposed infantry, weak against armor and air attacks.

levant-hzrecoilless-name = Recoilless Technical
levant-hzrecoilless-description = Mobile anti-armor fire on a fragile chassis. Signal coverage improves range and reload. Infantry and aircraft punish exposed vehicles.

levant-hzescort-name = Escort Gun Truck
levant-hzescort-description = Fragile mobile anti-air escort. Its ground fire discourages infantry; tanks and artillery counter it.

levant-hzrockets-name = Mobile Rocket Battery
levant-hzrockets-description = Long-range rocket artillery on a fragile mobile chassis. Spotter guidance improves coordinated fire; vulnerable when approached closely.

levant-hzdrone-name = Loiter Drone
levant-hzdrone-description = One-way airborne attack that consumes the drone. Scout the target first. Anti-air fire destroys it before impact.

levant-hzmissileboat-name = Coastal Missile Boat
levant-hzmissileboat-description = Light guided-missile craft. Coverage from a scout boat supports coordinated fire; poor armor demands spacing and an escort.

levant-hzskiff-name = Attack Skiff
levant-hzskiff-description = Inexpensive one-way attack boat. Requires a reachable water target and is consumed on impact. Patrol screens and concentrated fire counter it.

levant-hzsurvey-name = Coastal Survey Boat
levant-hzsurvey-description = Light patrol and reconnaissance craft with sonar and fleet guidance. Prioritize its sensors; heavy warships outgun it.

levant-hzbunker-name = Concealed Bunker
levant-hzbunker-description = Concealed defensive bunker with room for infantry. Attacking and damage reveal it. Detection and artillery counter it.

levant-hzaanest-name = Short-Range AA Nest
levant-hzaanest-description = Low-cost anti-air emplacement. Cannot substitute for armor defense. Artillery attacks outside its range.

levant-hzcoastal-name = Coastal Missile Emplacement
levant-hzcoastal-description = Concealed anti-armor missile emplacement able to engage vehicles and ships. Detection, infantry and artillery counter it.

levant-hzrelay-name = Signal Post
levant-hzrelay-description = Powered six-cell support aura and five-cell cloak detection. Losing power disables the benefits. Bonuses do not stack.

levant-hzworkshop-name = Field Workshop
levant-hzworkshop-description = Powered four-cell repair zone. Eligible vehicles repair 200 health per second below 70% health. Does not stack; unarmed and vulnerable.
